@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@documentId = 123
@storageRef = invoice.pdf

### Health check applicativo implicito: endpoint non previsto dal progetto
# Atteso: 404 Not Found, perche non abbiamo aggiunto Spring Actuator.
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health

### Process document - happy path invoice
# Prerequisito:
# - avviare l'app con `mvn spring-boot:run`
# - creare un file locale leggibile in `data/input/invoice.pdf`
#   esempio: `cp /path/to/file.pdf data/input/invoice.pdf`
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/documents/process
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "documentId": "{{documentId}}",
  "storageRef": "{{storageRef}}",
  "metadata": {
    "type": "invoice",
    "receivedAt": "2026-05-01T10:00:00Z"
  }
}

### Process document - happy path credit note
# Prerequisito: deve esistere `data/input/credit-note.pdf`.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/documents/process
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "documentId": "credit-note-001",
  "storageRef": "credit-note.pdf",
  "metadata": {
    "type": "credit_note",
    "receivedAt": "2026-05-01T10:00:00Z"
  }
}

### Process document - metadata receivedAt opzionale
# Prerequisito: deve esistere `data/input/invoice.pdf`.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/documents/process
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "documentId": "without-received-at",
  "storageRef": "invoice.pdf",
  "metadata": {
    "type": "invoice"
  }
}

### Bad request - documentId mancante
